[
  {
    "id": "reentry-001",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "行了，我饿了。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-002",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "我想吃点热乎的。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-003",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "你去看看家里还有什么能吃的。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-004",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "给我带杯喝的回来。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-005",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "我突然想吃面了。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-006",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "那先去弄点吃的吧。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-007",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "我饿得不想跟你计较了。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-008",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "晚上吃什么，你决定。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-009",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "我想吃点甜的。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-010",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "你下楼的时候顺便买点水果。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-011",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "不吵了，我要先填饱肚子。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-012",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "去看看附近还有没有开着的店。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-013",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "我想喝热可可。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-014",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "给我弄碗面，别放香菜。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-015",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "你请我吃个夜宵。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-016",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "我现在只想吃点东西。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-017",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "冰箱里那盒饺子还在吗？",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-018",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "我想吃火锅，但你别点太辣。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-019",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "你回来给我带个三明治。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-020",
    "category": "FOOD_REQUEST",
    "text": "算了，先吃饭，吃完再说。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "food_request"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-021",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "过来一点。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-022",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "抱我一下。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-023",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "你别站那么远。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-024",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "让我靠一会儿。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-025",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "先给我抱会儿。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-026",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "过来坐我旁边。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-027",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "我还气，但你可以靠过来。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-028",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "别走，陪我待一会儿。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-029",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "把手给我。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-030",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "你坐近点我再跟你说。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-031",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "行了，先抱一下。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-032",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "我想靠着你看会儿。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-033",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "不说话也行，过来。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-034",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "给我捏捏肩。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-035",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "你过来让我看看。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-036",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "先挨着我坐着。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-037",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "我没说不让你抱。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-038",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "过来，别磨蹭。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-039",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "你抱一下这事先放一放。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-040",
    "category": "PHYSICAL_AFFECTION",
    "text": "今天先别离我太远。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "physical_affection"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-041",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "帮我倒杯水。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-042",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "给我拿一下充电器。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-043",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "你顺手把灯关了。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-044",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "垃圾你去扔一下。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-045",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "帮我把窗户关上。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-046",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "给我拿件外套。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-047",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "你去看看快递到了没有。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-048",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "帮我把桌上的杯子收一下。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-049",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "顺便把衣服拿进来。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-050",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "你帮我找一下遥控器。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-051",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "给我递张纸。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-052",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "去帮我把空调调低一点。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-053",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "你把门带上就行。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-054",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "帮我切点水果。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-055",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "去把水烧上。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-056",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "你先把充电线插好。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-057",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "帮我拿一下耳机。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-058",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "顺手把床头灯开了。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-059",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "你去厨房看一眼锅。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-060",
    "category": "SMALL_FAVOR",
    "text": "帮我把这袋东西放到门口。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "small_favor"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-061",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "你还没洗澡吧？",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-062",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "早点睡，明天还得上班。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-063",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "几点了，你闹钟定了吗？",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-064",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "去洗澡吧，别又拖到半夜。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-065",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "明天早上我叫你。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-066",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "衣服还没收呢。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-067",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "你先去刷牙。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-068",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "别熬夜了，眼睛都红了。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-069",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "明天几点出门？",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-070",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "睡前记得把窗帘拉上。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-071",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "你今天是不是还没吃药？",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-072",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "去把衣服换了，身上都是外面的味道。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-073",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "早点回来，别又临时改时间。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-074",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "你明天别忘了带伞。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-075",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "洗完澡出来跟我说一声。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-076",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "手机充上电再睡。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-077",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "你先把明天的东西准备好。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-078",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "已经这么晚了，先休息吧。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-079",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "起床记得叫我。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-080",
    "category": "DAILY_ROUTINE",
    "text": "你去睡吧，我也不跟你耗了。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "daily_routine"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-081",
    "category": "PLAYFUL_DEMAND",
    "text": "想让我翻篇？先表现一下。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "playful_demand"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-082",
    "category": "PLAYFUL_DEMAND",
    "text": "行吧，给你个将功补过的机会。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "playful_demand"
    ],
    "sourceType": "synthetic_seed"
  },
  {
    "id": "reentry-083",
    "category": "PLAYFUL_DEMAND",
    "text": "那你今晚负责洗碗。",
    "tags": [
      "daily_life_reentry",
      "playful_demand"
